  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Chocolate Pig.png|200px|left|Chocolate Pig]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |Chocolate bunny = 25\n |level = 40\n |time = 1h\n |source = {{Infoicon|eastereggmaker2024|bigger|link=Easter Egg Maker}}\n |xp = 133\n |dia = 4\n |time3 = 54m\n}}\n'''Chocolate Pig''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 40. It's a special item used only for the Easter 2024 event. This is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 35 in Easter 2025 & 2026 Event.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making Chocolate Pig'''===\n[[File:Easter Egg Maker 2024.png|150px|left|Easter Egg Maker 2024|link=Easter Egg Maker]]\nChocolate pigs are made in the [[Easter Egg Maker]].\n\nTo make a chocolate pig, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Bacon.png|75px|Bacon|link=Bacon]]\n|[[File:Honey.png|75px|Honey|link=Honey]]\n|[[File:Apple.png|75px|Apple|link=Apple]]\n|-\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x3'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour to make a chocolate pig, and 54 minutes in a 2-star and fully [[Masteries|mastered]] station. Each chocolate pig gives players 133 [[experience]] points.\n\n'''In 2025 and 2026''', players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Apple Juice.png|75px|Apple Juice|link=Apple Juice]]\n|[[File:Goat Milk.png|75px|Goat Milk|link=Goat Milk]]\n|[[File:Potato.png|75px|Potato|link=Potato]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x5'''\n|}\nt takes 10 minutes to make a chocolate pig. Each chocolate pig gives players 67 [[experience]] points.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1-2 chocolate pigs per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat. Each chocolate pig used on a boat will be rewarded with 50 [[Chocolate Bunny]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n[[Category:Easter Egg Maker Products]]\n[[Category:Bacon Products]]\n[[Category:Honey Products]]\n[[Category:Apple Products]]\n[[Category:Apple Juice Products]]\n[[Category:Goat Milk Products]]\n[[Category:Potato Products]]\n{{Languages\n|es = Cerdo de chocolate\n}}",
